{"pageid":3027,"title":"Glass Ducky","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Glass Ducky</span>","revid":21146,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n<i><big>\"Don't drop it. Also, don't steal it!!! Dugg worked hard on that!\"</big></i>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Glass Ducky</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest?cb=20250220182005\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Missing Image\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250220182005 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Missing Image\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Missing_Image.png\" data-image-name=\"Missing Image.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dugg's Digging</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Free</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Very fragile, shatters easily.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Glass Ducky</b> is an almost transparent special item that can be found in a hidden room within the attic of <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging.</a> \n</p><p>It is free and can be obtained if the player is able to retrieve it from the attic without destroying it; a hard task to accomplish since it is made out of glass and thus is extremely fragile. Dropping it or colliding it with other objects will cause it to shatter.\n</p><p>A glass duck will become an Adult if you place it in the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck_Shrine\" title=\"Duck Shrine\">Duck Shrine</a>. Unlike a normal glass duck, the adult ones are completely <i>indestructible</i>; they can never shatter from any impact regardless of how hard the impact is.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Stealing the Glass Ducky is a difficult task and can be very time consuming. The player must navigate the duck through a narrow pathway in a room cramped with shelves, barrels and crates and back out from where they came from. \n</p><p>A quicker; or perhaps more efficient method to obtain the Glass Ducky is by utilizing the hole near the stairs and carefully placing it on the barrel beneath the stairs, drop down, then proceed to grab it again and carefully move it through the hole you came from, and then carefully drop your way down and proceed to walk out of the store. \n</p>\n <figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 320px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e5/Glassduckroom.png/revision/latest?cb=20240630042554\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The room where the Glass Duckys are stored.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e5/Glassduckroom.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20240630042554\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"79\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Glassduckroom.png\" data-image-key=\"Glassduckroom.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Glassduckroom.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The room where the Glass Duckys are stored.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Mini_crate.png/revision/latest?cb=20240722072003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Mini Crate is recommended for taking the Glass Ducky home to your base.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Mini_crate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240722072003\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"165\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Mini crate.png\" data-image-key=\"Mini_crate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Mini_crate.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Mini Crate is recommended for taking the Glass Ducky home to your base.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Mini_Crate\" title=\"Mini Crate\">Mini Crate</a> is recommended for taking the Glass Ducky home to your base, as it cannot shatter when it is inside. The Duckie can still break if the crate is dropped from a high distance or flipped upside down in some cases. \n</p><p>A pillow can be used in the bottom of the inside of crates to prevent them from breaking as easily.\n</p><p>When trying to turn the Glass Ducky into an Adult Glass Ducky, you can put in the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck_Shrine\" title=\"Duck Shrine\">Duck Shrine</a>, the same place where <a href=\"/wiki/Baby_Ducky\" title=\"Baby Ducky\">Baby Ducks</a> go; however, be aware of the narrow passageway and especially the lantern at the entry of the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck_Shrine\" title=\"Duck Shrine\">Duck Shrine</a>, you need to be very careful as you move it through, and it could easily be destroyed if you're not careful. \n</p><p>(tip, when the glass duck is in the box and you're putting the duck on the shrine, do not remove it from the box and risk breaking it, instead put the entire box on the shrine and never take it out until it's an adult)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>There are boxes within the same room that contain Glass Duckys with red text which claims it is \"not for sale\" but inspecting it will show the price of $999,999,999 Money which is extremely difficult, if not nearly impossible to obtain.</li>\n<li>Unlike normal glass, you CANNOT dye the Glass Ducky (Bummer, I know)</li>\n<li>A player named Godkingman292 has an astonishing mini 38 crates with 4 duckies per crate. It would take an astonishing amount of time to do this. He is able to do this because he has no life other than him playing Oaklands.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Screenshot_2024-07-21_190159.png/revision/latest?cb=20240722020242\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Glass Ducky successfully retrieved at someone&#39;s base.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Screenshot_2024-07-21_190159.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240722020242\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"96\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 2024-07-21 190159.png\" data-image-key=\"Screenshot_2024-07-21_190159.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Screenshot_2024-07-21_190159.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Glass Ducky successfully retrieved at someone's base.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 162px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Adult_Glass_Duck.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810232157\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A glass ducky after being placed in the shrine, becoming an adult glass ducky.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"162\" height=\"164\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Adult Glass Duck.png\" data-image-key=\"Adult_Glass_Duck.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Adult_Glass_Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/162?cb=20250810232157\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Adult_Glass_Duck.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810232157\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A glass ducky after being placed in the shrine, becoming an adult glass ducky.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Adult_Glass_Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/162?cb=20250810232157\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"162\" height=\"164\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Adult Glass Duck.png\" data-image-key=\"Adult_Glass_Duck.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Adult_Glass_Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/162?cb=20250810232157\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Adult_Glass_Duck.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A glass ducky after being placed in the shrine, becoming an adult glass ducky.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901150813\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser